# What the mission commands see of a player getting into and out of a car
# (docs/MISSION_VM.md, "In a car"): the player's ped's +0x66, +0x17 and
# +0x46, and the car's driver (+2), through getin_door.probe's get-in and
# get-out of the Bulldog. Run on the `getin` overlay
# (`gfa-tool probe-overlay getin`) with `--cycles 150000`. Each dump is
# 10 MB from 0, which gta8.py's Ram reads.
3500 tap esc 80
+2000 tap enter 80
+3000 tap enter 80
+1500 tap enter 80

17000 shot start
17050 memdump i00 0 a00000
17130 tap enter 70
17300 memdump i01 0 a00000
17600 memdump i02 0 a00000
17900 memdump i03 0 a00000
18300 memdump i04 0 a00000
18800 memdump i05 0 a00000
19300 memdump i06 0 a00000
19430 tap enter 70
19550 memdump i07 0 a00000
19750 memdump i08 0 a00000
20000 memdump i09 0 a00000
20400 memdump i10 0 a00000
21200 memdump i11 0 a00000
21300 shot after
21400 quit
